### Employee Attrition Prediction API - REST Client Requests

# Replace localhost with your server URL if testing against a deployed instance
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Get Model Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/model/metrics

### Single Employee Prediction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 45,
  "monthly_income": 5500,
  "years_at_company": 10,
  "years_in_current_role": 5,
  "years_with_curr_manager": 3,
  "total_working_years": 15,
  "job_satisfaction": 3,
  "work_life_balance": 3,
  "job_role": "Sales Executive",
  "department": "Sales",
  "distance_from_home": 5,
  "over_time": "No"
}

### Create Employee Record
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "department": "Sales",
  "job_role": "Sales Executive",
  "age": 45,
  "gender": "Male",
  "monthly_income": 5500,
  "years_at_company": 10,
  "job_satisfaction": 3,
  "work_life_balance": 3
}

### List All Employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees

### List Employees with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?skip=0&limit=10

### Filter Employees by Department
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?department=Sales

### Get Specific Employee
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/1

### Update Employee
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe Updated",
  "job_satisfaction": 4
}

### Delete Employee
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/1

### Get Department Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/department/Sales/stats

### Batch Prediction (requires CSV file)
# Note: This would require uploading a CSV file
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/predict/batch
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

# Note: Add CSV file upload here when testing
